 "salt": "yHaAIzX18qNx5V_Sp4Z4wQ==",
 "text": "Leborcham was an Irish heroine. She was the trusted nurse of the girl Deirdre. She was born a slave, yet she rose to high rank and became a bard. Her speed was renowned. She could run the whole length of Ireland in a single day and return by dawn with news. The king of Ulster, Concobar, trusted her as a messenger.",
